{"id":"cba9a676ba5427a0","group":"58","path":"58/batch03/58-lem-chain-condition.md","title":"Chain Condition Lemma","display":"lem-chain-condition — Chain Condition Lemma","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-lem-chain-condition","aliases":["58-lem-chain-condition"],"display":"lem-chain-condition — Chain Condition Lemma","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]","[[../batch14/58-df-countable.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-lem-chain-condition"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-lem-chain-condition</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-chain-condition — Chain Condition Lemma"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1b3610e6aed65b25\" href=\"?note=1b3610e6aed65b25\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-countable.md\">../batch14/58-df-countable.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P,\\leq,A,p,q,r\\in V\">\\(P,\\leq,A,p,q,r\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Poset}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Poset}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Countable}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Countable}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"1b3610e6aed65b25\" href=\"?note=1b3610e6aed65b25\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-countable.md\">../batch14/58-df-countable.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Compatible}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\land\\operatorname{Antichain}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{Compatible}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\land\\operatorname{Antichain}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicates defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ccc}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{ccc}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}chain\\text{-}condition\\text{-}compatible} \\vdash\n\\operatorname{Compatible}_S(p,q,P,\\leq)\\leftrightarrow\np,q\\in P\\land\\exists r\\in P\\;\n(\\langle r,p\\rangle\\in\\leq\\land\\langle r,q\\rangle\\in\\leq).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}chain\\text{-}condition\\text{-}compatible} \\vdash\n\\operatorname{Compatible}_S(p,q,P,\\leq)\\leftrightarrow\np,q\\in P\\land\\exists r\\in P\\;\n(\\langle r,p\\rangle\\in\\leq\\land\\langle r,q\\rangle\\in\\leq).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}chain\\text{-}condition\\text{-}antichain} \\vdash \\operatorname{Antichain}_S(A,P,\\leq)\\leftrightarrow A\\subseteq P\\land\\forall p,q\\in A\\;(p\\neq q\\to\\neg\\operatorname{Compatible}_S(p,q,P,\\leq))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}chain\\text{-}condition\\text{-}antichain} \\vdash \\operatorname{Antichain}_S(A,P,\\leq)\\leftrightarrow A\\subseteq P\\land\\forall p,q\\in A\\;(p\\neq q\\to\\neg\\operatorname{Compatible}_S(p,q,P,\\leq))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}chain\\text{-}condition\\text{-}definition} \\vdash \\operatorname{ccc}(P,\\leq)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq)\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathcal P(P)\\;(\\operatorname{Antichain}_S(A,P,\\leq)\\to\\mathrm{Countable}_S(A))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}chain\\text{-}condition\\text{-}definition} \\vdash \\operatorname{ccc}(P,\\leq)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq)\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathcal P(P)\\;(\\operatorname{Antichain}_S(A,P,\\leq)\\to\\mathrm{Countable}_S(A))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}chain\\text{-}condition\\text{-}equivalent} \\vdash\n\\operatorname{ccc}(P,\\leq)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq)\\land\n\\forall A\\in\\mathcal P(P)\\;\n\\bigl(\\neg\\mathrm{Countable}_S(A)\\to\n\\exists p,q\\in A\\;(p\\neq q\\land\\operatorname{Compatible}_S(p,q,P,\\leq))\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}chain\\text{-}condition\\text{-}equivalent} \\vdash\n\\operatorname{ccc}(P,\\leq)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq)\\land\n\\forall A\\in\\mathcal P(P)\\;\n\\bigl(\\neg\\mathrm{Countable}_S(A)\\to\n\\exists p,q\\in A\\;(p\\neq q\\land\\operatorname{Compatible}_S(p,q,P,\\leq))\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The compatibility convention is the forcing convention: two conditions have a common lower bound.</li>\n<li>The last equivalence avoids an unregistered cardinality operator: in ZFC, every uncountable subset of a c.c.c. poset contains two distinct compatible conditions.</li>\n<li>Quantification over candidate antichains is explicitly bounded by the set <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P(P)\">\\(\\mathcal P(P)\\)</span> rather than written as a class-style subset binder.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-df-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-countable.md","status":"resolved","id":"1b3610e6aed65b25","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-countable.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Poset}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-countable.md","status":"resolved","id":"1b3610e6aed65b25","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Countable}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch14/58-df-countable.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"P,\\leq,A,p,q,r\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Poset}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Countable}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Compatible}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\land\\operatorname{Antichain}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ccc}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}chain\\text{-}condition\\text{-}compatible} \\vdash\n\\operatorname{Compatible}_S(p,q,P,\\leq)\\leftrightarrow\np,q\\in P\\land\\exists r\\in P\\;\n(\\langle r,p\\rangle\\in\\leq\\land\\langle r,q\\rangle\\in\\leq).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}chain\\text{-}condition\\text{-}antichain} \\vdash \\operatorname{Antichain}_S(A,P,\\leq)\\leftrightarrow A\\subseteq P\\land\\forall p,q\\in A\\;(p\\neq q\\to\\neg\\operatorname{Compatible}_S(p,q,P,\\leq))","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}chain\\text{-}condition\\text{-}definition} \\vdash \\operatorname{ccc}(P,\\leq)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq)\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathcal P(P)\\;(\\operatorname{Antichain}_S(A,P,\\leq)\\to\\mathrm{Countable}_S(A))","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}chain\\text{-}condition\\text{-}equivalent} \\vdash\n\\operatorname{ccc}(P,\\leq)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq)\\land\n\\forall A\\in\\mathcal P(P)\\;\n\\bigl(\\neg\\mathrm{Countable}_S(A)\\to\n\\exists p,q\\in A\\;(p\\neq q\\land\\operatorname{Compatible}_S(p,q,P,\\leq))\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal P(P)","display":false}],"bytes":2123,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3877","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-lem-chain-condition.md|58-lem-chain-condition]]（batch03）"}],"outgoing":["d3f859dbdd37f018","1b3610e6aed65b25"]}